{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0d2044cb7f5d1e77170a8fc78a91d1fa00865b7ef8cad20c18af60d70fd61d91", "ja": "（今日は、恵美が765プロ劇場に初めて立つ日だ。\nさすがに緊張するな……）", "zh": "（今天是惠美第一次站上765艺能剧场的日子。\n她还是会紧张吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "107112abc3656348fd5dd9979aa6ea06ece8ecbb1f7229cdbc9449fc8df2e68b", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー……ワン、ツー、スリー……\nここでターンっ！", "zh": "1、2、3……1、2、3……\n在这里转圈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "72fb3340f0722c4f591ae1761c4a2bcf160f828f113c5d59f906c1f829860595", "ja": "（あの声……恵美か？\n楽屋から聞こえてくるみたいだ）", "zh": "（那声音是……惠美吗？\n好像是从休息室传出来的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "2be7d905a23d8b24952a7adc6d69f8937eba8051f9e425050ac265bbf87325fe", "ja": "うん、いいカンジ！\nアタシってば、ちゃんと動けてるじゃん♪", "zh": "嗯，感觉很棒！\n我跳得挺顺的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "58596bdff6624f6b23e8ee6426dc96c6eebd629587e42300cbbe4ac807e7ac7f", "ja": "恵美、お疲れさま。\nステップの確認か？", "zh": "惠美，辛苦了。\n你在确认舞步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "662a06e1a99bf0c96dea244742fe69c9f763ee464d6f6fef6e8799fad393d915", "ja": "えっ？\nあっ、{$P$}！", "zh": "咦？\n啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "01c8bbfa171c66b8494e5c559cb6e65e507a568bddb5495acb918a976c87c7a3", "ja": "もう、いるなら声かけてよ～。\n独り言聞かれるのって、結構恥ずかしいんだからね！", "zh": "真是的，既然你在就出个声嘛～\n被别人听到我在自言自语，很害羞耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6fc551dd9fd5191a612e493e2df410d4d476082ad1b22908f74fa0f35eac59c8", "ja": "ごめんごめん。けど、気合い入ってるな？\n廊下にまで、掛け声が聞こえてきたぞ。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。不过你跳得很起劲呢，\n我从走廊就听到你的声音了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "cf333bd126478a4428b3a04b0d7a9831bae26a9d919d69e5e0ca9912be1ad342", "ja": "あはは、ホントに？　恥ずかしいな……。\nなんか、ジッとしてると緊張してきちゃって。", "zh": "哈哈，真的？好害羞喔……\n因为要是待着不动，我就会开始紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "eada46ae4368b54ab1473ddf35de55bee4382594f8c58c09a70e3d1699444743", "ja": "今日のために練習して、自信つけたつもりだったんだ\nけど……いざ本番ってなると、やっぱ、ね。", "zh": "虽然我为了今天不断练习，想培养信心……\n但要正式上场前还是……你知道的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "69ba9a8cfedb18f444b072429e102c77d990cb81d5e88138b431e72f8edcf584", "ja": "初舞台だからな。\n緊張するなっていうのも、難しい話だと思う。", "zh": "毕竟是首次登台表演嘛。\n应该很难不紧张吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "4debf041d4257d5345214a31dff31e998173b2ac5aee8abf1a2ded72dfe26064", "ja": "うん。でもね、リハーサルの時は空っぽだった会場が、\n今、お客さんでいっぱいでしょ？", "zh": "嗯。话说回来，排练时空荡荡的会场，\n现在已经涌入许多观众了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e979e42094007e7854a8bc9c01e33f3e9bc28e9f2bb478ea9049c80e658921c5", "ja": "ああ、おかげで満員御礼だ。", "zh": "是呀，多亏大家的支持，挤满了观众。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "395a5dff114aed11329b28a3081e54a6ff628eb69743a787f17768930bd9003b", "ja": "失敗したらどうしようって、不安な気持ちもあるけど\n……それよりも、なんかワクワクしてるんだよね！", "zh": "虽然也会担心要是失败该怎么办……\n但比起那些，我现在更觉得跃跃欲试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "6e6b2060fb695a93ac310675a56cc7d07a34bb53454db6c11a763a2db1b15c01", "ja": "レッスンで頑張ったコト……アタシ達の歌やダンスで、\n会場のみんなが楽しんでくれたらいいな～なんて♪", "zh": "要是在训练中努力练习的歌舞……能透过我们今天的表演\n让会场观众乐在其中就好了～我是这么想的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8c8d5f09babf3c343f831b932320933caa637d9802f005262776e870888cda64", "ja": "そうか。\nその気持があるなら、大丈夫だと思う。", "zh": "是吗。\n既然你有这个心，我想就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "192cd726a767f778367449af30de5daf3df7f5ce1e0018aa4233321897330a6b", "ja": "えへっ、そっかな？　……って、ゴメン！\nなんか、アタシばっかり喋ってるね？　アハハ……。", "zh": "嘿嘿，是这样吗？啊，抱歉！\n感觉我一直自顾自地说个不停呢，哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "752e5059e8102bbaedc2c4ba0e878fd6cef4d097fd0362ef0f324be87719ba68", "ja": "そうでもないよ。それに、こうやって話を聞くのも、\nプロデューサーの仕事だしな。", "zh": "没这回事啦。而且像这样听你说话，\n也是制作人的职责啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "c457d5a2439f69d2273c5520121de65a03c74213689fe584c0cfd9cae8f54626", "ja": "そう言ってくれると助かるよ～。", "zh": "谢谢你这样说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "40c301debf6481b166d2e336534919fe4d7ec4f105304d71bdf0cc187593d8ba", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}。なんだか、\nあっと言う間にここまで来ちゃったカンジだけど……", "zh": "对了，{$P$}。\n总觉得时间过得好快，一下就到了今天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "c2dd5b06173c39a426e061b01e29ad037742a1020e304d4121f5d822fbbc15fc", "ja": "アタシ、ちゃんとアイドルできてるかな？", "zh": "你觉得我是个称职的偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1021_p", "source_sha256": "3750af61ef1a7dd5c1291b8a1fb417e692d8c9c5576e79218d795c2704c1e885", "ja": "そのための準備はしっかりやってきたし、\n恵美ならきっと、いいステージにできる。", "zh": "你一直很努力准备，\n我想惠美肯定能带来很棒的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1022_p", "source_sha256": "97d8d62d5ce396c208cf18a4c454674e495541467fdc70c07cd27e7b5bd375f2", "ja": "今日がアイドルとしての第一歩だ。\nどんなことがあっても、ちゃんと支えていくからな！", "zh": "今天是你作为偶像迈出的第一步，\n无论如何，我都会好好支持你走下去的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "d318a72a7cf65bc53b8b6463902f4cd1b964d6ae109048f8d1fde358f19d3aa3", "ja": "ぷっ……あは、あはははは！　も～！\nそんなキザなセリフ、他の人は絶対言えないよ～。", "zh": "噗……哈哈，哈哈哈哈！真是的～！\n那么装模作样的话，其他人绝对说不出口的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1024_p", "source_sha256": "479539dc9548d85666f389884e9fa3132a5e7480546a67ef351bb80fad8f7d9e", "ja": "うっ。\nキザだったか？", "zh": "唔，\n这很装模作样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1025_020meg", "source_sha256": "177c9ea2a6dd005dc0585c6675e80e91e612829b120895217d90be7110205f68", "ja": "うん！　でも、元気出たよっ！\n{$P$}、ありがとねっ♪", "zh": "嗯！可是我恢复活力了！\n{$P$}，谢谢你啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "29ad983d800646f7141bae2f9245e076a2a4487fb2eab524ee6cbd8c276006d7", "ja": "んじゃ、約束通り……アタシのファーストステージ、\nちゃ～んと見守っててよね♪", "zh": "那就按照约定……我首次登台表演的模样，\n你要好～好看清楚喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_020meg_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_003_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f17af708e7df8597a622d25945b2d0e70e1e970c3f054ca74eb2c50b0c1557e1", "ja": "（この調子なら、大丈夫そうだ。本番でどんな\nパフォーマンスを見せてくれるか、楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（看她这样，应该不用担心吧。\n真期待她正式上场时带来的表演！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
